                                                                                                           biotop:MaterialObject
                                                                                                           biotop:Process) ; 
                                                                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>].
biotop:CongenitalAbnormalStructure <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> "biological structure that deviates from what is considered normal and that already existed at birth";
