biotop:DNAChain <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> "A DNA is a complex, high-molecular-weight biochemical macromolecule composed of deoxyribonumcleotide chains that convey genetic information. Any kind of NucleicAcid that is composed of Deoxyribonucleotides is here defined as DNA.";
