biotop:OligoOrPolymer <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> "An oligo or polymer macromolecular structure is a molecule of moderate to high relative molecular mass, the structure of which essentially comprises the multiple repetition (n >= 2) of units derived from molecules of low relative molecular mass.";
                      a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                      rdfs:label "oligo or polymer";
                      rdfs:subClassOf [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> biotop:hasComponentPart ; 
