biotop:OrganicMolecularEntity <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> "Substances containing carbon and its derivatives as their prinicipal elements, usually combined with itself and with atoms of one or more other element such as hydrogen, oxygen, nitrogen, sulfur, phosphorus, chlorine or fluorine. They exist in either carbon chain or carbon ring form. Excludes carbides, carbonates and carbon oxides.";
                              a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                              rdfs:label "organic molecular entity";
                              rdfs:subClassOf biotop:MolecularEntityByOrganicInorganicPartition.
biotop:OrganicMolecularEntityPartition a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
