biotop:Steroid <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> "One of a group of polycyclic, 17-carbon-atom, fused-ring compounds occurring both in natural and synthetic forms. Included here are naturally occurring and synthetic steroids, bufanolides, cardanolides, homosteroids, norsteroids, and secosteroids. (UMLS SN)";
