biotop:TaxonValueRegion <http://purl.org/imbi/ru-meta.owl#definition> """abstract region in which the values of biological taxa are located (cf. Schulz et.al ISMB 2008). Biological taxa can be ascribed not only to organisms but also to ogranism parts, derivates, as well as populations.

